比如木材、纸张、橡胶等等。

61
00:04:16,420 --> 00:04:19,420
If it is lit, then it is class A fire.
如果这些着火了，就是 A 类火灾。

62
00:04:19,420 --> 00:04:22,420
Now let's see what comes in class B fire.
现在我们来看看 B 类火灾包括什么。

63
00:04:22,420 --> 00:04:28,420
So in class B fire comes flammable liquid i.e. such liquid which is Jvalanchil.
B 类火灾包括易燃液体，也就是易燃的液体，

64
00:04:28,420 --> 00:04:32,420
