then the fire class of it will change.
它的火灾类别就会改变。

93
00:06:03,420 --> 00:06:06,420
i.e. we gave the power supply to the computer,
也就是说，我们给电脑接了电源，

94
00:06:06,420 --> 00:06:08,420
but it cut off the power supply.
但后来切断了电源，

95
00:06:08,420 --> 00:06:10,420
Later if it is lit,
之后如果着火了，

96
00:06:10,420 --> 00:06:13,420
